    "source_text": "TRIS(DIBENZYLIDENEACETONE)DIPALLADIUM(0) (9.10 mg, 9.94 µmol) was added to 2-bromo-1-methyl-4-nitrobenzene (42.9 mg, 0.20 mmol), 2-methylquinoline-6-carboxamide (37.0 mg, 0.20 mmol), cesium carbonate (194 mg, 0.60 mmol) and (9,9-dimethyl-9H-xanthene-4,5-diyl)bis(diphenylphosphine) (11.50 mg, 0.02 mmol) in dioxane (2 mL) at 20°C under nitrogen. The resulting solution was stirred at 100 °C for 6 hours. Reaction seen to be progressing but very sluggish (5% conversion). Reaction abandoned.    ",
